<title>USA: Tracor unit wins $51 mln, 5-yr contract.</title>
<headline>Tracor unit wins $51 mln, 5-yr contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>GDE Systems Inc, a unit of Tracor Inc, said Tuesday it had won a five-year, $51 million contract, including options, from the Defense Department's Special Weapons Agency.</p>
<p>The contract covers upgrade work on the air vehicle planning system, a software program used by the U.S. Strategic Command for automated mission planning of aircraft and cruise missile weapon systems.</p>
